## V5 contract

Author:

- canonical domain/reference TTL under `model/ontologies/`;
- source-vocabulary TTL under `integration/sources/`;
- one closed `EntityBinding` per source relation or contracted dbt model under
  `integration/bindings/`;
- optional ordinary contracted dbt SQL/YAML under `integration/transforms/dbt/models/`;
- optional dbt seed CSVs (small, static, hand-maintained reference data) with optional
  sibling column-docs YAML under `integration/transforms/dbt/seeds/`;
- optional Gold/MDM policy TTL under `model/extensions/`.

Do not add claims, preparation or Silver-extension authority, lifecycle/readiness state,
release evidence, or generated files as authored inputs.

## Compile

```bash
uv run kairos-ontology compile <domain> --check
uv run kairos-ontology compile <domain> --explain --format json
uv run kairos-ontology compile <domain> --emit
```

The adapter is selected in `kairos.yaml` (`fabric` or `databricks`). Every invocation
builds one immutable `CompilePlan`; check and explain do not write. Bare `--emit`
writes the unified dbt project to `ontology-hub-publish/medallion/dbt`.

On `databricks`, the Gold Power BI semantic model is `directQuery` and needs warehouse
coordinates per deployment environment in `kairos.yaml`:

```yaml
gold:
  databricks_connection:
    default_environment: DEV
    environments:
      DEV:
        server_hostname: adb-1111111111111111.11.azuredatabricks.net
        http_path: /sql/1.0/warehouses/dev0000000000000
      PROD:
        server_hostname: adb-2222222222222222.22.azuredatabricks.net
        http_path: /sql/1.0/warehouses/prod000000000000
```

The TMDL carries the `default_environment` values and the projector emits a fabric-cicd
`parameter.yml` that rewrites them per target environment at deploy time. Gold projection
on `databricks` fails closed while the block is missing. Fabric Direct Lake needs nothing
here.

## Ontology conventions

- One domain per lowercase, hyphenated `.ttl` file.
- Every ontology declares `owl:Ontology`, `rdfs:label`, and `owl:versionInfo`.
- Classes use PascalCase; properties use camelCase.
- Keep `_master.ttl` imports current.
- Keep samples synthetic and free of personal or proprietary data.

V5 is a clean break. Rebuild v4 hubs from this scaffold; no compatibility or conversion
command is provided.
